a = x^3 - 6x^2 + 11x - 6
b = x^2 - 3x + 2
a + b = x^3 - 5x^2 + 8x - 4
a - b = x^3 - 7x^2 + 14x - 8
a * b = x^5 - 9x^4 + 31x^3 - 51x^2 + 40x - 12
a / b = x - 3 remainder 0
a' = 3x^2 - 12x + 11
gcd(a, b) = x^2 - 3x + 2
a(1/2) = -15/8
integer roots of a: [1 2 3]
half = 1/2x^2 + 3/4, squared = 1/4x^4 + 3/4x^2 + 9/16
degree of a * b: 5
x^^2 is unreadable
2y + 1 is unreadable
-x^2 + x reads as -x^2 + x
